== Documented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* Add parameter in Options.ini where you can turn off Steam Cloud.
* Add ALT + F2 shortcut on Stats page to import Steam [[achievement]]s.

=== Fixes ===
* Added soundtrack files of the Afterbirth DLC.
* Added some lost items to the item pools.
* Fixed crash on using FBO in OpenGL 2 contexts.
* Fixed some issues with Steam Cloud Sync.
* Fixed [[The Haunt]] staying invulnerable sometimes.
* Fixed other gameplay related bugs.
* Fixed OS X black screen issue.
* Fixed player position when returning from [[black market]].
* Fixed crash when fighting one of the final bosses.
* Fixed Xbox 360 controller issues on Linux.

== Undocumented changes ==
=== Changes ===
* Increased the default range of [[Azazel]]'s {{i|Brimstone}}.<ref>http://i.imgur.com/CjASJjg.png</ref>
* Improved the effect of Range Up items on [[Azazel]]'s {{i|Brimstone}}.<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/2lfbpr/the_binding_of_isaac_rebirth_known_pc_issues/clullmn</ref>
* Decreased {{i|Dark Bum}}'s heart conversion rate to a 1.5:1 ratio.<ref>http://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/2lnjio/the_binding_of_isaac_rebirth_version_101_release/clwhhc3</ref>

